{"seq":3,"slug":"spa-monitoring-challenges","title":"SPA 监控与软导航挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/operations/spa-monitoring-challenges","wordCount":903,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"spa-监控与软导航挑战\">SPA 监控与软导航挑战</h1><p>传统的性能监控建立在&quot;一次导航 = 一次页面加载&quot;的假设上，但单页应用（SPA）打破了这个假设。React Router、Vue Router、Next.js App Router 的客户端路由切换不会触发完整的页面加载——Navigation Timing 不会重新产生，LCP Observer 不会重置，CLS 会继续累积。这让 SPA 的性能监控面临独特挑战，也催生了&quot;软导航&quot;（Soft Navigation）检测标准的演进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SPA 中存在两种截然不同的导航类型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户导航行为] --&gt; B{导航类型}&#10;    B --&gt; C[硬导航&lt;br/&gt;Hard Navigation]&#10;    B --&gt; D[软导航&lt;br/&gt;Soft Navigation]&#10;    C --&gt; E[完整页面加载&lt;br/&gt;所有 API 重新触发]&#10;    C --&gt; F[Navigation Timing 产生&lt;br/&gt;LCP/CLS/INP 重置]&#10;    D --&gt; G[客户端路由切换&lt;br/&gt;DOM 局部更新]&#10;    D --&gt; H[无 Navigation Timing&lt;br/&gt;指标状态不重置]&#10;    H --&gt; I[传统监控盲区]\">graph TD\n    A[用户导航行为] --&gt; B{导航类型}\n    B --&gt; C[硬导航&lt;br/&gt;Hard Navigation]\n    B --&gt; D[软导航&lt;br/&gt;Soft Navigation]\n    C --&gt; E[完整页面加载&lt;br/&gt;所有 API 重新触发]\n    C --&gt; F[Navigation Timing 产生&lt;br/&gt;LCP/CLS/INP 重置]\n    D --&gt; G[客户端路由切换&lt;br/&gt;DOM 局部更新]\n    D --&gt; H[无 Navigation Timing&lt;br/&gt;指标状态不重置]\n    H --&gt; I[传统监控盲区]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>硬导航</th>\n<th>软导航</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTTP 请求</td>\n<td>完整 HTML 文档请求</td>\n<td>无文档请求（仅 API/资源）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DOM 状态</td>\n<td>完全重建</td>\n<td>局部更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Navigation Timing</td>\n<td>完整时间线</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LCP</td>\n<td>重新开始测量</td>\n<td>不重置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLS</td>\n<td>重置为 0</td>\n<td>继续累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INP</td>\n<td>重置</td>\n<td>继续记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>URL 变化</td>\n<td>浏览器历史完整刷新</td>\n<td>History API pushState</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"soft-navigation-api-实验性标准\">Soft Navigation API（实验性标准）</h2><p>Chrome 团队正在推进 Soft Navigation API（Chrome 实验性标准，2025-2026 逐步成熟），旨在让浏览器自动识别 SPA 的客户端路由切换，并为每次软导航重置性能指标：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 检测浏览器是否支持 Soft Navigation（实验性）&#10;if (PerformanceObserver.supportedEntryTypes.includes(&#39;soft-navigation&#39;)) {&#10;  const observer = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;    for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {&#10;      console.log(&#39;Soft navigation detected:&#39;, {&#10;        name: entry.name, // 新 URL&#10;        startTime: entry.startTime, // 导航开始时间&#10;        duration: entry.duration, // 导航耗时&#10;      });&#10;      // 在此触发新&quot;页面&quot;的性能指标采集&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;  observer.observe({ type: &#39;soft-navigation&#39;, buffered: true });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 检测浏览器是否支持 Soft Navigation（实验性）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (PerformanceObserver.supportedEntryTypes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'soft-navigation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Soft navigation detected:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        name: entry.name, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 新 URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        startTime: entry.startTime, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 导航开始时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        duration: entry.duration, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 导航耗时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 在此触发新\"页面\"的性能指标采集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'soft-navigation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, buffered: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Soft Navigation 被浏览器识别的条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>在用户交互的事件处理函数内触发</li>\n<li>URL 通过 History API 或 Navigation API 发生了变化</li>\n<li>导致了 DOM 的可见变更（非空操作）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"当前生产方案-手动路由监控\">当前生产方案：手动路由监控</h2><p>在 Soft Navigation API 完全普及之前（Safari/Firefox 尚无支持），生产环境需要手动追踪路由切换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// React Router 集成示例&#10;import { useEffect, useRef } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;import { useLocation } from &#39;react-router-dom&#39;;&#10;import { onLCP, onINP, onCLS } from &#39;web-vitals&#39;;&#10;&#10;export function RoutePerformanceTracker() {&#10;  const location = useLocation();&#10;  const navigationStart = useRef&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;  const previousPath = useRef&lt;string&gt;(&#39;&#39;);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    if (previousPath.current === location.pathname) return;&#10;&#10;    // 标记软导航开始&#10;    navigationStart.current = performance.now();&#10;    previousPath.current = location.pathname;&#10;&#10;    // 自定义&quot;软导航 LCP&quot;：路由切换后首个有意义的渲染&#10;    const measureSoftLCP = () =&gt; {&#10;      const observer = new MutationObserver((mutations) =&gt; {&#10;        // 检测有实质内容变化（非空 DOM 更新）&#10;        const hasContentChange = mutations.some((m) =&gt; m.addedNodes.length &gt; 0 || m.type === &#39;characterData&#39;);&#10;        if (hasContentChange) {&#10;          const softLCP = performance.now() - navigationStart.current;&#10;          reportMetric({&#10;            name: &#39;soft-lcp&#39;,&#10;            value: softLCP,&#10;            page: location.pathname,&#10;          });&#10;          observer.disconnect();&#10;        }&#10;      });&#10;      observer.observe(document.getElementById(&#39;root&#39;)!, {&#10;        childList: true,&#10;        subtree: true,&#10;        characterData: true,&#10;      });&#10;      // 超时兜底&#10;      setTimeout(() =&gt; observer.disconnect(), 10000);&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    measureSoftLCP();&#10;  }, [location.pathname]);&#10;&#10;  return null;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// React Router 集成示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useEffect, useRef } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useLocation } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-router-dom'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { onLCP, onINP, onCLS } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'web-vitals'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-d